# Files in this repo that must NOT be served at avyxon.ai.
#
# The site is deployed by Vercel's Git integration straight from the repo
# root, and robots.txt is `Allow: /` for every crawler including GPTBot and
# ClaudeBot. Anything committed here is public and gets ingested unless it is
# listed below. Verified 2026-11-11: before this file existed,
# https://avyxon.ai/CLAUDE.md and https://avyxon.ai/docs/*.md all returned 200.
#
# Rule of thumb: if it is written for us rather than for a visitor, it goes here.

# Internal process docs, architecture notes, deployment runbook
docs/

# Agent/contributor instructions
CLAUDE.md

# Contact-form backend source (deployed separately to Google Apps Script)
apps-script/

# CI workflow definitions
.github/

# Client outcome records must never live in this repo at all (see
# docs/outcome-capture-template.md), but exclude the path as a second guard.
clients/
*outcome-record*
